==Battleground==
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dhalsim (Enemy)|Dhalsim]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

